[00:41.10]1. Loyal love! God is love.
[00:48.04]We can sense his care from above.
[00:53.86]God by means of his precious Son
[01:01.68]Paid the ransom for ev’ryone,
[01:07.81]Giving hope that we might possess
[01:14.65]Life eternal and happiness.
[01:22.69](Chorus)
[01:22.69]Hey there, all you thirsty ones,
[01:29.81]Come and drink life’s water free.
[01:35.49]Yes, come drink, you thirsty ones;
[01:42.63]God’s loyal love you’ll see.
[01:57.81]2. Loyal love! God is love.
[02:04.73]All his works give proof of his love.
[02:11.71]Love Jehovah has further shown,
[02:17.41]Giving Jesus the kingly throne.
[02:25.39]God’s own purpose has come to pass.
[02:32.43]See! His Kingdom is here at last!
[02:38.65](Chorus)
[02:39.15]Hey there, all you thirsty ones,
[02:46.11]Come and drink life’s water free.
[02:52.05]Yes, come drink, you thirsty ones;
[03:00.03]God’s loyal love you’ll see.
[03:10.85]3. Loyal love! God is love.
[03:17.65]May his spirit move us to love.
[03:24.31]As we loyally help the meek,
[03:30.41]God’s commandments they learn to keep.
[03:37.31]We are serving with godly fear,
[03:44.25]Preaching boldly for all to hear.
[03:51.33](Chorus)
[03:52.13]Hey there, all you thirsty ones,
[03:59.09]Come and drink life’s water free.
[04:05.25]Yes, come drink, you thirsty ones;
[04:16.11]God’s loyal love you’ll see.
